PART 2 — MODEL WEIGHTS
Applies to: weights/*.xmodel (compiled INT8 models) and the FP32 checkpoints
listed in weights/MANIFEST.csv
================================================================================

These models were trained on a proprietary Thai licence-plate dataset provided
by an industrial partner. The dataset itself is not redistributed. The weights
are released under the following terms:

