                            from the authors and Design Gateway Co., Ltd.

  Contact for permissions : Supavadee Aramvith (corresponding author),
                            supavadee.a@chula.ac.th

  Warranty ...............: The weights are provided "as is", without warranty
                            of any kind. The authors accept no liability for
