PART 3 — THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL
================================================================================

The dataset preparation scripts download data from third parties under their own
licences, which are not altered by this repository:

  * Open Images V7 (class "Vehicle registration plate") — annotations CC BY 4.0,
    images under their respective licences; see the Open Images website.
  * CCPD / CCPD2020 — see the terms published by its maintainers.
  * OpenALPR benchmark images — see the terms published by its maintainers.
